                                "sense_id": "45282a7b-329a-3808-8bbd-9cbd7c09c383",
                                "text": "We currently have three dogs: an Australian Shepherd(M), a bagle(F), and an Akita(M) (yes, 'bagle' is intentional.) The Aussie and the Akita are frighteningly smart while the bagle is dumb as a stick but sweet-tempered."
                            },
