                                "sense_id": "45282a7b-329a-3808-8bbd-9cbd7c09c383",
                                "text": "I am not in the running either, but we have three furbabies. 2 AKC registered beagles ( 1 bluetick, and 1 lemon) and then there is the puppy. He is a bagle. Basset/ Beagle mix."
